{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where Birds Go To Sleep is a narrative adventure mystery game like no other - a blend of Tabletop Role-Playing Games, Point &amp; Click Adventures and mystery games with narrative choices and world exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the tower built to reach the heavens and meet God nears completion<i> - an island appears in the distant sea. Prisoners are sent to establish a colony and chart it.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slip into the mind of Cormo, a villainous pirate-turned-explorer driven by greed as he embarks on a secret mission within the prison island. The journey goes awry - Cormo is shipwrecked, and toxic, mind-numbing fog shrouds the island. <i>The prison colony is strangely quiet\u2026</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/8de354664e3d9d06d7b6857034146be0.poster.avif?t=1755204478\" width=780 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/8de354664e3d9d06d7b6857034146be0.webm?t=1755204478\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/8de354664e3d9d06d7b6857034146be0.mp4?t=1755204478\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/2715ca0c32c30b630f3ecc005686cd91.avif?t=1755204478\" width=6160 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The whole island presents a multi-layered, interlocking mystery. Delve into the depths of the prison colony, a shifting island covered in a strange, mind-altering fog. Solve diegetic puzzles, and uncover secrets hidden around every corner. It\u2019s up to you to find them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/e6108ea812f9286ec39b3ac899d5fe04.poster.avif?t=1755204478\" width=780 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/e6108ea812f9286ec39b3ac899d5fe04.webm?t=1755204478\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/e6108ea812f9286ec39b3ac899d5fe04.mp4?t=1755204478\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Collect clues and use items - Secrets hide in plain sight, and you will have to use tools both mundane and cosmic to uncover them: such as a shovel or a rope, but also time, gravity, perspective, spoken clues and your own sanity.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/5f4c24997cb97e12ae171b1a2e01a063.poster.avif?t=1755204478\" width=613 height=118 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/5f4c24997cb97e12ae171b1a2e01a063.webm?t=1755204478\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/6f7d1335506657b8767c9b2718886444.avif?t=1755204478\" width=6160 height=850 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See the world through the eyes of a mentally and morally unstable person. Delve into difficult topics and taboos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your journey you will meet a handful of developed, complex characters. Become their friend, learn their desires, and then\u2026 lie, manipulate, cheat, commit depraved acts; become what you hate; or fight against your nature.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/cb74a648007129a351b51ba8505b5c94.poster.avif?t=1755204478\" width=780 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/cb74a648007129a351b51ba8505b5c94.webm?t=1755204478\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/cb74a648007129a351b51ba8505b5c94.mp4?t=1755204478\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/7637d6b9e2deeb7cfb57b8fb27e1c040.avif?t=1755204478\" width=6160 height=850 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s all about awareness and knowledge. Stats and attributes may ease your journey, but they won\u2019t solve the cosmic mysteries for you. Uncover secrets and hidden messages around every corner. Fully missable. It\u2019s up to you to find them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Around us are things we don\u2019t understand. Invisible demons, devils, coincidences, dreams and dangers unexplored.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/6279775adc4e4f54cb263d3013e98635.poster.avif?t=1755204478\" width=780 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/6279775adc4e4f54cb263d3013e98635.webm?t=1755204478\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/6279775adc4e4f54cb263d3013e98635.mp4?t=1755204478\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/670cc159be775041c32580c8bbe675b6.avif?t=1755204478\" data-has-big width=800 height=117 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choices affect things big and small - a different description, a different option, a different inner world - a different Cormo, wrestling for control against <u><strong>you</strong></u>. Manipulate him into doing your bidding, break him and override his will, or cooperate and work as a team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The experimental <strong>Heart System</strong> will re-contextualise your experience and challenge you to see things in new and exciting ways in and outside of the game as well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/7f2069a7b64aa1f366d3ed5e223ac108.poster.avif?t=1755204478\" width=780 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/7f2069a7b64aa1f366d3ed5e223ac108.webm?t=1755204478\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/7f2069a7b64aa1f366d3ed5e223ac108.mp4?t=1755204478\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/903c00eb9ef312c03211e2809d02d4f7.avif?t=1755204478\" width=6160 height=850 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no golden path or fail states; every \u201cno\u201d or failure - and sometimes, even death - lead to new opportunities and paths to discover. What has happened cannot be undone.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/5e395e23fc384e5db356502ded1d3bd8.poster.avif?t=1755204478\" width=780 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/5e395e23fc384e5db356502ded1d3bd8.webm?t=1755204478\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/5e395e23fc384e5db356502ded1d3bd8.mp4?t=1755204478\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/6a05411859335d360aa7c5a4d784bba9.avif?t=1755204478\" width=6160 height=850 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a richly detailed, fictional world inspired by the mythical Middle East, but set at the turn of the 16th century, where exotic fantasy and harsh reality meet.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brought to life with stunning hand painted art, stellar voice acting and atmospheric and haunting soundtrack composed and recorded in-house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story spanning the entire spectrum of human emotion; trivial, humorous, disgusting, grotesque, and tragic. All at once.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/75320e46a7de945f4bc366b4782d2e87.avif?t=1755204478\" width=6160 height=850 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quiet Little Feet is a husband-and-wife team currently working on Where Birds Go to Sleep. We are fascinated by player-driven narratives, choices and the consequences such stories can have both on and outside of the screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our goal is to revolutionise narrative-driven video games and video-game storytelling by bringing player agency into the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/419395e5df0b614a9a781111cf383fa0.avif?t=1755204478\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1387640?t=1755204478","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755204478","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755204478","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755204478","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This Game may contain content not appropriate for all ages. For a detailed list of content warnings, visit wbgts.com/cw\r\n\r\nSome player choices and dialogue options may lead to this kind of content."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where Birds Go To Sleep is a narrative adventure mystery game like no other - a blend of Tabletop Role-Playing Games, Point &amp; Click Adventures and mystery games with narrative choices and world exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the tower built to reach the heavens and meet God nears completion<i> - an island appears in the distant sea. Prisoners are sent to establish a colony and chart it.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slip into the mind of Cormo, a villainous pirate-turned-explorer driven by greed as he embarks on a secret mission within the prison island. The journey goes awry - Cormo is shipwrecked, and toxic, mind-numbing fog shrouds the island. <i>The prison colony is strangely quiet\u2026</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/8de354664e3d9d06d7b6857034146be0.poster.avif?t=1755204478\" width=780 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/8de354664e3d9d06d7b6857034146be0.webm?t=1755204478\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/8de354664e3d9d06d7b6857034146be0.mp4?t=1755204478\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/2715ca0c32c30b630f3ecc005686cd91.avif?t=1755204478\" width=6160 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The whole island presents a multi-layered, interlocking mystery. Delve into the depths of the prison colony, a shifting island covered in a strange, mind-altering fog. Solve diegetic puzzles, and uncover secrets hidden around every corner. It\u2019s up to you to find them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared