/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/cb74a648007129a351b51ba8505b5c94.poster.avif?t=1755204478\" width=780 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/cb74a648007129a351b51ba8505b5c94.webm?t=1755204478\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/cb74a648007129a351b51ba8505b5c94.mp4?t=1755204478\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/7637d6b9e2deeb7cfb57b8fb27e1c040.avif?t=1755204478\" width=6160 height=850 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s all about awareness and knowledge. Stats and attributes may ease your journey, but they won\u2019t solve the cosmic mysteries for you. Uncover secrets and hidden messages around every corner. Fully missable. It\u2019s up to you to find them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Around us are things we don\u2019t understand. Invisible demons, devils, coincidences, dreams and dangers unexplored.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/6279775adc4e4f54cb263d3013e98635.poster.avif?t=1755204478\" width=780 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/6279775adc4e4f54cb263d3013e98635.webm?t=1755204478\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/6279775adc4e4f54cb263d3013e98635.mp4?t=1755204478\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/670cc159be775041c32580c8bbe675b6.avif?t=1755204478\" data-has-big width=800 height=117 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choices affect things big and small - a different description, a different option, a different inner world - a different Cormo, wrestling for control against <u><strong>you</strong></u>. Manipulate him into doing your bidding, break him and override his will, or cooperate and work as a team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The experimental <strong>Heart System</strong> will re-contextualise your experience and challenge you to see things in new and exciting ways in and outside of the game as well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/7f2069a7b64aa1f366d3ed5e223ac108.poster.avif?t=1755204478\" width=780 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/7f2069a7b64aa1f366d3ed5e223ac108.webm?t=1755204478\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/7f2069a7b64aa1f366d3ed5e223ac108.mp4?t=1755204478\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/903c00eb9ef312c03211e2809d02d4f7.avif?t=1755204478\" width=6160 height=850 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no golden path or fail states; every \u201cno\u201d or failure - and sometimes, even death - lead to new opportunities and paths to discover. What has happened cannot be undone.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/5e395e23fc384e5db356502ded1d3bd8.poster.avif?t=1755204478\" width=780 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/5e395e23fc384e5db356502ded1d3bd8.webm?t=1755204478\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/5e395e23fc384e5db356502ded1d3bd8.mp4?t=1755204478\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/6a05411859335d360aa7c5a4d784bba9.avif?t=1755204478\" width=6160 height=850 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a richly detailed, fictional world inspired by the mythical Middle East, but set at the turn of the 16th century, where exotic fantasy and harsh reality meet.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brought to life with stunning hand painted art, stellar voice acting and atmospheric and haunting soundtrack composed and recorded in-house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story spanning the entire spectrum of human emotion; trivial, humorous, disgusting, grotesque, and tragic. All at once.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/75320e46a7de945f4bc366b4782d2e87.avif?t=1755204478\" width=6160 height=850 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quiet Little Feet is a husband-and-wife team currently working on Where Birds Go to Sleep. We are fascinated by player-driven narratives, choices and the consequences such stories can have both on and outside of the screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our goal is to revolutionise narrative-driven video games and video-game storytelling by bringing player agency into the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/419395e5df0b614a9a781111cf383fa0.avif?t=1755204478\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Quiet Little Feet"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/header.jpg?t=1755204478","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 16.04 LTS (64bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core 2 Duo E5200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce 9800GTX+ (1GB)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 9 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> 1080p, 16:9 recommended</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 16.04 LTS (64bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 560<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 9 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> 1080p, 16:9 recommended</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1387640/422208/6316b7ee1677c339d64c6157c2bb8a6274743b6c/1751231108/dash_av1.mpd?t=1683324045","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1387640/422208/6316b7ee1677c339d64c6157c2bb8a6274743b6c/1751231108/dash_h264.mpd?t=1683324045","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"http